{"version":1,"content":"<p>系統被某個程序佔滿處理器資源導致任務管理器都點不動，這是 Windows 用户非常熟悉的情況。10 月 27 日微軟資深工程師雷蒙德陳在開發者博客上回答了被大家反覆提出的問題，然後否定把任務欄和任務管理器設置高優先級的思路。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586864.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T05:46:25.186231+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:35:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:43.157745+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:39:43.157745+00:00","content_hash":"4e3ffcc51651a1dca9e9e9ab139b0c594859b29bd32dfc69fd8898be7e1fdeb9","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}